    <https://w3id.org/kpxl/gen/terms/isVisibleTo> <https://w3id.org/kpxl/gen/terms/AdminRole> .
  
  sub:maintained-resources-view a <https://w3id.org/kpxl/gen/terms/ListView>, <https://w3id.org/kpxl/gen/terms/ResourceView>;
    dct:isVersionOf <https://w3id.org/np/RA9lZA-e3b3oMS9XHhbGOeV_Fvs2q9yFBQ7c4xcG2JNkE/maintained-resources-view-kind>;
